WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.341
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:37.620
[foreboding music playing]

00:43.084 --> 00:44.002
Bu-yeon.

00:44.502 --> 00:48.339
Is this where you can see the energy
of the stone that shines?

00:48.423 --> 00:49.549
[Bu-yeon] Father.

00:49.632 --> 00:50.842
It is close.

00:52.177 --> 00:55.472
That pretty stone lies
somewhere beneath the waters.

01:02.020 --> 01:05.190
Do you think what she has found
is truly the ice stone?

01:05.774 --> 01:06.858
It must be.

01:07.817 --> 01:12.197
That little girl, who was born and blessed
with the mighty power of the ice stone,

01:12.280 --> 01:15.200
seems to have found the ice stone
that my master sealed,

01:15.784 --> 01:17.577
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:18.912 --> 01:22.957
I am certain that Bu-yeon
is of Jang Gang's bloodline.

01:23.541 --> 01:26.419
He must have used sorcery
to save her since she is his.

01:27.670 --> 01:29.339
Do you resent her?

01:38.848 --> 01:40.475
It is because of that child

01:40.558 --> 01:43.978
that the princess of the Jin family
who was out of my league

01:44.771 --> 01:47.148
has decided to marry someone like me.

01:49.234 --> 01:50.777
I should be grateful to her.

01:54.072 --> 01:57.867
It is here.
The pretty stone is right below us.

02:00.787 --> 02:03.289
[suspenseful music playing]

02:09.462 --> 02:12.257
[Jin Mu] Jin Bu-yeon died
because of her father

02:12.340 --> 02:15.343
who was blinded by his own
inferiority and jealousy.

02:17.804 --> 02:19.055
It suits you well.

02:19.139 --> 02:20.140
[Ho-gyeong chuckles]

02:20.223 --> 02:23.309
If you like the eye mask,
then I like it too, Mother.

02:25.270 --> 02:27.480
- [Ho-gyeong] Shall we try a different one?
- [Bu-yeon chuckles]

02:30.483 --> 02:32.277
[Jin Mu]
Jin Bu-yeon's immense divine powers

02:32.861 --> 02:35.405
did not only come from her mother
of the Jin family.

02:36.322 --> 02:40.952
They also came from her father,
a descendant of the fallen Choi family.

02:41.870 --> 02:42.996
[Shaman Choi grunts]

02:43.830 --> 02:47.167
Shaman siblings, who barely made
a living through divinations

02:47.250 --> 02:48.793
were of the bloodline of Choi,

02:48.877 --> 02:52.005
the first mage to perform
the alchemy of souls

02:52.088 --> 02:53.882
using the ice stone.

02:54.382 --> 02:57.510
Jin Bu-yeon was a priestess
with incredible divine powers

02:57.594 --> 03:01.222
who inherited the blood
of both those families.

03:02.599 --> 03:04.142
You finally found it.

03:05.226 --> 03:06.060
[Jin Mu] Bu-yeon.

03:06.644 --> 03:08.062
Give the ice stone to me.

03:11.149 --> 03:13.443
[loud rumbling]

03:20.199 --> 03:21.367
Give it to me.

03:26.664 --> 03:27.707
[U-tak] Bu-yeon.

03:28.291 --> 03:31.127
Bu-yeon. Bu-yeon!

03:31.961 --> 03:33.046
Bu-yeon.

03:41.095 --> 03:44.140
[somber music playing]

03:59.072 --> 04:00.740
[woman] Eat up, here.

04:01.824 --> 04:03.243
Here, your spoon.

04:04.410 --> 04:06.537
It's a pity that

04:06.621 --> 04:09.332
you cannot see
or even remember your own name.

04:09.415 --> 04:10.708
[woman] Hmm.

04:11.793 --> 04:13.920
Would you like to live with me? Hmm?

04:14.796 --> 04:18.549
My granddaughter who's been dead now
was called Mu-deok.

04:18.633 --> 04:19.801
Would you like to be Mu-deok?

04:22.387 --> 04:23.888
[woman] Mm. Mm-hmm.

04:23.972 --> 04:26.349
I will call you Mu-deok, okay?
[laughs]

04:26.432 --> 04:28.059
Gosh, what a good girl.

04:28.142 --> 04:30.561
Go on, eat up, eat up. Yes.

04:30.645 --> 04:31.980
[woman chuckles]

04:36.067 --> 04:37.443
Mu-deok.

04:39.195 --> 04:41.572
[epic music playing]

05:20.069 --> 05:21.237
Oh, Mother…

05:21.321 --> 05:23.573
[intense music playing]

05:28.661 --> 05:30.204
[Ho-gyeong] Bu-yeon.

05:45.678 --> 05:46.888
How is it that…

05:48.681 --> 05:51.559
the same thing happened as the day
Jin Bu-yeon disappeared?

06:02.820 --> 06:03.905
[Beom sighs]

06:04.655 --> 06:06.157
Mu-deok still isn't back.

06:06.240 --> 06:09.619
It looks like both she and Uk
have been killed by the soul shifter.

06:09.702 --> 06:11.704
At this rate, we'll all die too.

06:18.461 --> 06:19.587
Jin Bu-yeon.

06:19.670 --> 06:22.381
Did you not bring the ice stone here
from Jinyowon with your own hands?

06:23.132 --> 06:25.802
[Go Won] You're also a priestess.
Have you not any power to control it?

06:26.803 --> 06:29.639
I only brought it here
because my mother ordered me to do so.

06:30.515 --> 06:32.391
How pathetic you are.
[scoffs]

06:33.476 --> 06:36.104
Young Master Seo has lost too much blood.

06:36.938 --> 06:39.440
If we don't get him more blood energy,
he will die.

06:40.525 --> 06:42.610
If he needs blood, I will give him mine.

06:42.693 --> 06:44.987
We cannot cast spells in here,

06:45.071 --> 06:46.906
so we cannot transfer energy.

06:54.455 --> 06:55.832
[Jin Mu] Just give me your hand.

06:56.332 --> 06:58.334
[suspenseful music playing]

07:01.879 --> 07:04.090
[gasping]

07:05.550 --> 07:08.594
[U-tak] This worm that has sucked
the blood of my daughter, Cho-yeon,

07:08.678 --> 07:11.472
will grant you the energy
of the Jin family.

07:14.725 --> 07:18.729
[Jin Mu] We have all been manipulated
by Jang Uk's lies.

07:20.398 --> 07:23.943
The Unanimous Assembly
have viewed the Words of the Heart.

07:24.026 --> 07:28.281
It is merely a poem that makes
no mention of the ice stone.

07:32.160 --> 07:34.162
Songrim needs to explain this.

07:37.206 --> 07:38.458
Everybody has read it,

07:39.584 --> 07:41.711
but there is something else
they have missed.

07:48.801 --> 07:50.303
[Jang Uk] The Words of the Heart

07:50.386 --> 07:53.306
actually contains Master Seo Gyeong's
confession of love.

07:53.389 --> 07:56.100
He left a confession?

07:56.684 --> 08:00.229
It is a heartfelt love letter
to Jinyowon's first leader,

08:00.313 --> 08:01.772
Jin Seol-ran.

08:03.191 --> 08:07.278
It is a letter saying he left
an ice stone behind

08:08.029 --> 08:11.407
because he could not let go
of his lover who was dying.

08:13.493 --> 08:15.411
So Master Seo Gyeong

08:15.495 --> 08:18.831
left behind the ice stone
because he could not let go of love?

08:19.790 --> 08:21.459
He is just making all of this up.

08:22.043 --> 08:25.630
I have proof that it is actually
a heartfelt love letter.

08:27.465 --> 08:30.009
If you think of the name of the recipient,

08:30.593 --> 08:33.971
you, too, can read the Words of the Heart
with no problem, Your Majesty.

08:34.055 --> 08:35.932
I can read it even with…

08:36.891 --> 08:38.559
my limited magical abilities?

08:39.268 --> 08:40.603
Her name means

08:40.686 --> 08:45.107
a blue orchid blooming in the cold snow,

08:46.901 --> 08:48.402
Seol-ran, Your Highness.

08:49.779 --> 08:51.113
"Seol-ran"?

08:52.198 --> 08:54.200
[dramatic music playing]

09:10.466 --> 09:12.468
[dramatic music continues playing]

09:23.437 --> 09:26.107
[Jin] "The faint, blue light…"

09:35.324 --> 09:38.786
Consumed by his grief over Seol-ran
as she was dying.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.038
In the end,

09:41.622 --> 09:44.917
Seo Gyeong calls himself a fool
who dared not shed…

09:46.127 --> 09:48.004
a single tear.

09:50.631 --> 09:52.300
It is a confession saying

09:52.383 --> 09:55.803
he left the ice stone to save his lover.

09:59.390 --> 10:01.434
[Ho-gyeong]
But Lady Jin Seol-ran passed away

10:01.517 --> 10:03.519
soon after establishing Jinyowon,

10:03.603 --> 10:07.982
from all those wounds that she sustained
during the Great Chaos.

10:08.065 --> 10:11.736
If he had left the ice stone to save her,
why would she not have used it and died?

10:12.361 --> 10:16.157
It was probably her choice
in order to prevent that dangerous power

10:16.824 --> 10:18.576
from coming back out into the world.

10:19.744 --> 10:22.663
What human being would be able
to refuse such a great power?

10:22.747 --> 10:24.498
Of course, someone like you…

10:25.708 --> 10:28.210
would never make such a selfless decision.

10:28.294 --> 10:31.130
However, because she was human.

10:32.381 --> 10:33.633
As a human being…

10:35.343 --> 10:37.803
in order to protect
what must be protected,

10:40.264 --> 10:45.519
one makes the choice
to give up everything.

11:02.370 --> 11:03.913
Now that you've drawn your sword,

11:05.581 --> 11:06.791
you must decide.

11:12.046 --> 11:13.547
I know you've been avoiding it.

11:13.631 --> 11:16.634
And I know that your decision
could kill all of us.

11:18.969 --> 11:22.640
As we promised,
point your sword at me first.

11:28.813 --> 11:29.688
[sighs]

11:35.027 --> 11:36.987
[Mu-deok's soul] An overflowing spirit

11:37.071 --> 11:40.199
is not something you can just discard
after you're done with it.

11:40.699 --> 11:43.327
Just as you can't avoid floods
after wanting rain

11:43.911 --> 11:46.664
or avoid typhoons if you want wind.

11:46.747 --> 11:48.416
You must bear it.

11:48.499 --> 11:51.377
Then, even if I take this power,
I cannot use it as I wish?

11:52.670 --> 11:55.506
There is something
you could do as you wish.

11:57.758 --> 11:58.926
To not use it.

12:00.261 --> 12:03.806
The choice to not use that power
is up to you.

12:17.278 --> 12:19.113
Make your next promise…

12:21.323 --> 12:23.200
to me right now, Young Master.

12:26.328 --> 12:28.289
[gentle music playing]

12:39.425 --> 12:41.010
[Master Lee] In this world,

12:41.093 --> 12:44.138
there is a very sad star
called the King's Star.

12:46.515 --> 12:48.684
[girl] What is the King's Star?

12:49.393 --> 12:50.978
[Master Lee]
It is a star that appears for someone

12:51.061 --> 12:53.105
who is allowed to use the sky's energy.

12:53.189 --> 12:55.774
It means your power
gets even stronger, right?

12:55.858 --> 12:57.526
That's a really good thing.

12:58.402 --> 13:01.864
I am not so sure.
I do not think it's that good.

13:01.947 --> 13:03.908
You see, if you are given great power,

13:03.991 --> 13:05.951
you also have to bear many things.

13:06.035 --> 13:07.995
You mean, bear, like an animal?

13:08.078 --> 13:09.914
It means doing things you don't wanna do.

13:10.623 --> 13:12.875
It is a painful and lonesome star.

13:12.958 --> 13:16.504
Mister, may we have some of those, please?

13:17.713 --> 13:18.672
[Master Lee] Of course.

13:19.715 --> 13:22.635
- I will leave these with you.
- Thank you very much, sir.

13:22.718 --> 13:26.388
But be sure to take care
that you don't fight over it.

13:26.472 --> 13:28.098
[girl] I will. Let's go.

13:30.559 --> 13:32.645
[dramatic music playing]

13:38.442 --> 13:40.152
[Master Lee] The star will soon appear.

13:41.278 --> 13:44.782
And then, when it does,
those who must go will go

13:44.865 --> 13:46.784
and those who must return will return.

13:53.832 --> 13:57.670
This is the place that the Crown Prince
was trying to visit.

13:58.337 --> 14:00.381
[Cho-yeon] The apothecary that Eunuch Kim,

14:00.464 --> 14:02.841
who served the Queen,
visited once a month.

14:02.925 --> 14:05.177
You know your way around, don't you?

14:05.886 --> 14:09.807
Oh! Uh, did you get that Lovers' Charm
here in Gaema Village as well?

14:09.890 --> 14:11.016
[scoffs]

14:11.100 --> 14:14.562
Don't tease me over a charm
that was not even effective.

14:14.645 --> 14:18.107
What do you mean, it wasn't effective?
We're here together now.

14:18.691 --> 14:23.362
Ugh. I mean, it's not like we're here
on a romantic outing.

14:25.322 --> 14:26.699
[chuckles]

14:29.118 --> 14:30.953
[ominous music playing]

14:31.787 --> 14:34.915
What… what is he doing here?

14:36.917 --> 14:39.503
APOTHECARY

14:39.587 --> 14:41.380
[gasps]
Father?

14:52.641 --> 14:54.602
[coins clinking]

14:55.769 --> 14:58.689
[suspenseful music playing]

15:19.251 --> 15:21.670
It seems you have come back
to your senses.

15:21.754 --> 15:24.340
[U-tak] I see you tried
to hurt yourself again, Your Highness.

15:24.423 --> 15:26.425
Why are you keeping me alive?

15:27.259 --> 15:29.428
Please just kill me already.

15:29.511 --> 15:32.890
Not yet. Because while your body is alive,

15:33.515 --> 15:36.435
your Lantern of Life
must not be extinguished.

15:36.518 --> 15:38.103
[shudders]

15:39.688 --> 15:42.816
Seeing my sister's eyes
glare at me like that

15:43.484 --> 15:45.861
makes my heart ache unbearably.

15:45.945 --> 15:48.197
If you need to blame someone,

15:48.280 --> 15:50.240
blame the person who ruined…

15:51.200 --> 15:53.118
the lives of me and my sister.

15:54.328 --> 15:55.412
[Shaman Choi grunts]

16:05.214 --> 16:07.466
Shaman Choi, you are accused
of cursing other people

16:07.549 --> 16:09.635
through the use of forbidden divination.

16:10.803 --> 16:12.304
Do you admit to your crimes?

16:15.683 --> 16:17.476
[dark music playing]

16:17.559 --> 16:20.688
All I have done is
accept my customers' money

16:20.771 --> 16:21.730
and do as they asked.

16:21.814 --> 16:25.401
The crime lies with those who asked me
to perform those curses.

16:25.484 --> 16:27.319
Someone died from one of your curses.

16:28.362 --> 16:30.698
Still, you insist that you're innocent?

16:33.909 --> 16:36.620
For your divination
to take someone's life away,

16:36.704 --> 16:38.247
you must have great divine powers.

16:38.872 --> 16:39.999
Perhaps…

16:40.874 --> 16:45.295
it could be great enough
to even kill a mage.

16:46.588 --> 16:48.382
[snickers]

16:50.759 --> 16:53.512
Find all of the spell books and tools
she used to perform.

16:54.013 --> 16:55.681
- Right now!
- [mages] Yes.

16:55.764 --> 16:58.142
[thrilling music playing]

16:58.225 --> 17:00.519
[clicks tongue, scoffs]

17:13.157 --> 17:14.825
No. Not that one.

17:15.451 --> 17:16.952
It has been passed down

17:17.036 --> 17:19.038
through my humble family for generations.

17:19.121 --> 17:20.914
That has not been used for divination,

17:20.998 --> 17:23.167
so please do not burn it. Please.

17:23.250 --> 17:24.418
CHEONGANG

17:24.501 --> 17:25.669
[Gang] It is a book of spells.

17:25.753 --> 17:26.795
Ah. No…

17:27.588 --> 17:28.505
Burn it.

17:28.589 --> 17:30.007
[Shaman Choi yelps]

17:31.383 --> 17:33.010
No.

17:33.093 --> 17:34.762
[screaming]

17:35.679 --> 17:37.097
CHEONGANG

17:53.447 --> 17:55.032
Put out the flames. Hurry.

17:55.115 --> 17:56.158
[mages] Yes.

18:01.955 --> 18:07.002
CHEONGANG

18:15.010 --> 18:17.304
THE ALCHEMY OF SOULS

18:17.888 --> 18:19.431
"The alchemy of souls"?

18:25.062 --> 18:26.855
[ominous music playing]

18:33.612 --> 18:35.030
- [Shaman Choi groaning]
- [U-tak] Hold on.

18:40.369 --> 18:42.579
[Shaman Choi choking]

18:46.166 --> 18:48.460
[groaning]

18:52.965 --> 18:54.550
The start of all of this,

18:55.259 --> 18:57.553
my sister's face being burned,
and her soul

18:57.636 --> 19:00.055
being shifted into your body,

19:00.139 --> 19:01.640
it's all because of him.

19:03.559 --> 19:04.726
Jang Gang.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.563
Jang…

19:08.438 --> 19:09.731
Gang.
[groans]

19:11.400 --> 19:13.068
You must not die yet.

19:13.694 --> 19:15.737
Please live on for a little longer…

19:16.947 --> 19:18.240
in my sister's body,

19:19.241 --> 19:20.325
Your Royal Highness.

19:20.409 --> 19:22.161
[groaning]

19:25.664 --> 19:27.875
It's been ten years
since I shifted to this body,

19:29.334 --> 19:32.880
but I still suffer whenever
she regains her senses.

19:33.630 --> 19:36.633
I would have killed her
if it weren't for that Lantern of Life.

19:36.717 --> 19:38.969
Your brother has gone to medicate her,

19:40.345 --> 19:42.264
so you will soon feel well again.

19:42.347 --> 19:43.599
[breathes heavily]

19:43.682 --> 19:44.683
But…

19:46.101 --> 19:48.729
how did the ice stone
end up in Jeongjingak?

19:48.812 --> 19:51.315
It was Jin Ho-gyeong's first time
handling it,

19:51.398 --> 19:52.649
so she must have done it wrong.

19:53.650 --> 19:54.943
When it's time,

19:55.903 --> 19:58.947
I'll use the alchemy of souls
to take the ice stone's power.

20:01.200 --> 20:04.536
If you take it now, everyone
in Jeongjingak will certainly die.

20:04.620 --> 20:05.746
They probably will.

20:06.288 --> 20:07.873
The Crown Prince is in there.

20:09.708 --> 20:10.876
So what?

20:12.419 --> 20:14.963
You must take it
only after the Crown Prince

20:15.047 --> 20:16.465
has gotten out safely.

20:16.548 --> 20:18.175
And if he cannot get out?

20:19.009 --> 20:21.053
Do you intend to just leave it there?

20:21.136 --> 20:24.640
What if somebody takes the power first
while we are still waiting?

20:24.723 --> 20:28.310
Fortunately, no one can touch it
because they are all wary of each other.

20:29.561 --> 20:33.482
We must first figure out a way
to rescue his Royal Highness.

20:40.489 --> 20:42.366
[brooding music playing]

20:47.621 --> 20:48.789
Oh, Mother.

20:53.460 --> 20:55.254
[breathes deeply]

20:55.337 --> 20:56.713
I must have misheard her.

20:57.464 --> 20:58.840
Why would she call me that?

21:00.008 --> 21:01.176
It makes no sense.

21:08.058 --> 21:09.142
Everyone's…

21:10.686 --> 21:12.854
greed for the ice stone is greater…

21:14.940 --> 21:17.567
than their concern for the children
trapped in the barrier.

21:19.111 --> 21:21.947
We, at least, should make an attempt
to break it.

21:23.782 --> 21:26.702
If we try without the Unanimous Assembly,

21:27.286 --> 21:28.996
they will only start fighting again.

21:30.914 --> 21:33.250
The ice stone belongs to Jinyowon,

21:33.333 --> 21:35.961
so you should stop trying
to make more decisions about it.

21:36.044 --> 21:37.087
Lady Jin.

21:37.629 --> 21:41.466
Has that ice stone
truly never left Jinyowon,

21:41.550 --> 21:43.844
not even once in the past 200 years?

21:46.471 --> 21:49.599
You said once that a Songrim mage
had entered Jinyowon.

21:49.683 --> 21:50.976
Was that mage…

21:52.978 --> 21:54.229
Jang Gang by any chance?

21:58.233 --> 22:00.110
I am asking you…

22:00.944 --> 22:05.157
if the ice stone has ever been
in Jang Gang's hands.

22:06.074 --> 22:07.492
[shudders]

22:07.576 --> 22:09.870
[tense music playing]

22:09.953 --> 22:11.204
[gasps]

22:16.209 --> 22:18.128
[Ho-gyeong]
The child inside me is not moving.

22:18.211 --> 22:20.714
I have borne this child for 13 months.

22:20.797 --> 22:21.923
I cannot lose it.

22:22.007 --> 22:23.633
[sobbing]

22:24.259 --> 22:25.510
I must save it.

22:26.136 --> 22:28.013
I'm so sorry to hear that, Lady Jin,

22:28.889 --> 22:30.599
but I can't save a child
that's already dead.

22:30.682 --> 22:31.808
[gasps]

22:35.771 --> 22:36.980
Within Jinyowon…

22:38.815 --> 22:40.609
there is an ice stone.

22:41.735 --> 22:43.070
An ice stone you said?

22:43.153 --> 22:45.572
[Ho-gyeong] Why do you act so surprised
when you already suspected it?

22:45.655 --> 22:48.784
You pestered me time after time
to let you into Jinyowon…

22:49.826 --> 22:52.454
to search for the ice stone,
isn't that right?

22:56.041 --> 22:57.667
I heard the ice stone

22:57.751 --> 23:02.047
has the power to bring the souls
of the dead back to their bodies.

23:03.215 --> 23:04.382
I don't have…

23:06.093 --> 23:08.053
the power to control the ice stone.

23:08.637 --> 23:09.721
Jang Gang.

23:10.514 --> 23:12.682
But you might be able to do it.

23:14.851 --> 23:16.937
Are you asking me to use sorcery?

23:17.020 --> 23:19.689
I do not care if you use sorcery
if it will save my child. Please.

23:22.484 --> 23:23.443
Please.

23:24.653 --> 23:26.822
Help me keep this child. Will you?

23:27.322 --> 23:29.241
[Ho-gyeong sobs]

23:37.457 --> 23:41.962
[Ho-gyeong] That day, in order to revive
the child that had died in my womb,

23:42.045 --> 23:44.673
I opened the doors of Jinyowon to him.

23:45.257 --> 23:50.011
And as a result,
Jinyowon lost the ice stone.

23:57.269 --> 23:58.770
If that is the case,

23:59.563 --> 24:01.815
would it not be worse for Songrim?

24:01.898 --> 24:05.443
Since it was a Songrim mage,
who was thought to be the most righteous,

24:05.527 --> 24:07.362
that took the ice stone

24:07.445 --> 24:10.907
and disturbed peace
by trying to shift souls.

24:13.493 --> 24:16.204
That is why I also wanted to conceal it.

24:17.080 --> 24:18.123
However,

24:19.332 --> 24:22.544
in order to expose
and rectify the situation,

24:23.670 --> 24:26.256
I will reveal Songrim's shameful affairs…

24:27.883 --> 24:29.217
and cut them out.

24:29.926 --> 24:32.137
[mysterious music playing]

24:33.013 --> 24:35.432
To do that, you will have to cut off
what you treasure

24:35.515 --> 24:37.017
like your own flesh and blood.

24:39.102 --> 24:40.437
It will be very painful.

24:42.480 --> 24:43.690
Yes, it will.

24:46.067 --> 24:47.027
But if…

24:47.777 --> 24:52.032
that is the way to rectify
this whole situation once and for all,

24:55.035 --> 24:57.871
I will do what's necessary.

25:02.209 --> 25:03.835
[Shaman Choi groans]

25:07.297 --> 25:09.883
My sister who's possessing your body

25:09.966 --> 25:13.845
will shift into the girl we brought in
as Jinyowon's eldest daughter.

25:14.387 --> 25:15.680
Once that happens,

25:16.181 --> 25:19.851
just as you wish, I will grant you death.

25:19.935 --> 25:21.686
[groaning softly]

25:25.899 --> 25:28.568
[tense music playing]

25:32.948 --> 25:33.990
[gasps]

25:34.908 --> 25:35.951
Cho-yeon.

25:37.994 --> 25:39.204
What…

25:39.287 --> 25:40.872
what are you doing here?

25:43.416 --> 25:44.501
Father.

25:45.710 --> 25:46.836
What…

25:48.129 --> 25:49.965
on earth did I…

25:51.132 --> 25:52.425
just hear?

25:56.763 --> 25:59.516
Who is that person?

26:01.226 --> 26:03.228
Is the real Queen…

26:05.480 --> 26:07.440
the person who's inside that body?

26:10.026 --> 26:11.736
[breathes deeply]

26:17.534 --> 26:18.493
[grunts]

26:19.077 --> 26:19.953
[gasps]

26:23.540 --> 26:24.582
[Dang-gu grunts]

26:32.716 --> 26:33.800
[grunts]

26:37.012 --> 26:39.597
Father. You must not.

26:42.642 --> 26:44.394
[tense music playing]

26:47.355 --> 26:48.898
[grunting]

26:57.490 --> 27:00.243
[coughs, exhales]

27:00.994 --> 27:02.120
[exhales deeply]

27:14.341 --> 27:15.633
[sighs deeply]

27:24.559 --> 27:26.853
[ominous music playing]

27:41.159 --> 27:42.202
Did you come…

27:43.203 --> 27:44.454
back here, My lord?

27:54.172 --> 27:55.256
Maidservant Kim.

27:56.257 --> 27:57.675
It has been a long time.

28:01.971 --> 28:03.306
Gwanju Jang Gang.

28:10.355 --> 28:12.357
[ominous music playing]

28:27.205 --> 28:29.207
[tense music playing]

28:43.221 --> 28:44.597
It is the soul shifter.

28:47.559 --> 28:49.769
[Beom] It looks like
Uk managed to kill him.

28:50.353 --> 28:51.438
He was killed in one go.

28:52.689 --> 28:55.859
How did he beat this man
when he cannot use spells?

28:58.236 --> 28:59.904
[Go Won] Where have Uk and Mu-deok gone?

28:59.988 --> 29:01.072
Find them.

29:01.781 --> 29:03.032
Yes, Your Highness.

29:13.793 --> 29:17.005
When we first entered this energy
of the ice stone, I had a vision.

29:17.964 --> 29:20.467
It said that
no one can possess the ice stone.

29:20.550 --> 29:22.010
One can only use it.

29:23.344 --> 29:25.638
Because it's the energy of the sky.

29:25.722 --> 29:27.891
Even with one's human energy,

29:27.974 --> 29:31.144
if you cannot control it in your body,
it can never be yours.

29:31.227 --> 29:34.105
Which human can control the energy
of the sky and possess it?

29:34.189 --> 29:37.609
It is not mine, so I cannot use it
however I please.

29:37.692 --> 29:38.526
That's what it means.

29:41.321 --> 29:42.739
If I cannot possess it,

29:43.823 --> 29:45.408
what if I gave it everything?

29:46.117 --> 29:47.494
Give it everything?

29:47.577 --> 29:51.372
If I gave all of my energy to the sky,

29:51.915 --> 29:54.250
my energy would become that of the sky.

29:57.837 --> 29:59.964
I read something about the ice stone

30:00.048 --> 30:02.008
in one of Jeongjingak's secret books.

30:03.718 --> 30:06.638
[Jang Uk] The ice stone has no fixed form,

30:06.721 --> 30:09.057
so it can be water, fire, or wind.

30:09.641 --> 30:11.851
Its size cannot be fathomed either,

30:11.935 --> 30:15.438
so it can be very small or enormously big.

30:17.315 --> 30:20.276
It means this mass fog
surrounding Jeongjingak like a barrier

30:20.360 --> 30:22.654
is not the ice stone's true form.

30:22.737 --> 30:24.781
In other words,
the ice stone could change into

30:24.864 --> 30:27.742
water or fire or get bigger
or smaller than this.

30:28.326 --> 30:29.369
Yes.

30:29.452 --> 30:32.997
Then, do you think
you could make it fall as rain?

30:33.623 --> 30:34.624
Rain?

30:34.707 --> 30:37.544
You said I could not win
against the ice stone because…

30:38.169 --> 30:40.046
I can barely create a drop of water.

30:40.129 --> 30:44.759
But if that one drop of water
turn into hundreds, thousands of drops…

30:46.594 --> 30:48.179
Then it would fall as rain.

30:48.805 --> 30:50.557
It does not sound impossible.

30:51.224 --> 30:53.142
But then, you would have to use Tansu,

30:53.226 --> 30:55.562
- and if you do that--
- I would lose all of my energy.

30:56.604 --> 30:59.732
That is why I said
that I'd have to give it everything.

31:03.903 --> 31:04.904
You can't.

31:04.988 --> 31:06.698
Let's think of another way.

31:06.781 --> 31:09.826
If we hesitate, the Queen will take
the ice stone and its power,

31:10.660 --> 31:11.828
then we'll all die.

31:11.911 --> 31:13.705
With the Unanimous Assembly watching,

31:14.205 --> 31:16.207
they won't be able to make a move easily.

31:16.291 --> 31:18.877
Jang Uk, don't do this.

31:19.419 --> 31:21.087
That's an order as your master.

31:29.804 --> 31:32.432
I gave up on this power
because I have no choice,

31:32.515 --> 31:34.225
I can't let you lose everything too.

31:35.643 --> 31:37.729
We've been through so much to get here.

31:38.563 --> 31:40.148
Me always pushing you to your death,

31:40.231 --> 31:43.401
and you, building up your energy
as you overcame it each time.

31:48.406 --> 31:51.993
You're going to throw all of that away
to make a drop of water?

31:55.413 --> 31:57.081
Yul is badly wounded.

31:57.165 --> 31:59.792
If we don't act, he will die.

32:05.506 --> 32:06.841
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

32:07.467 --> 32:10.637
You gave it up
because you tried to protect it.

32:14.098 --> 32:15.516
I'm trying to do the same.

32:16.392 --> 32:20.313
And Yul has also been protecting you
all this time.

32:23.024 --> 32:25.610
[pensive music playing]

32:26.277 --> 32:28.154
[ragged breathing]

32:30.573 --> 32:34.035
[Yun-ok] If we don't get him
more blood energy, he will die.

32:37.413 --> 32:39.958
[So-i] This worm has the blood energy
of the Jin family.

32:40.041 --> 32:41.626
If I put this in him…

32:47.507 --> 32:49.050
[So-i gasps]

32:57.100 --> 32:58.184
[So-i groans]

33:00.645 --> 33:01.813
[gasps]

33:07.485 --> 33:08.945
[Seo Yul moans softly]

33:12.782 --> 33:14.450
[So-i sobbing]

33:18.121 --> 33:19.872
Please don't die, Young Master.

33:21.499 --> 33:22.667
Do not die.

33:30.758 --> 33:33.511
[breathing heavily]

33:42.854 --> 33:44.147
[whimpers]

33:46.399 --> 33:48.317
[Soul Ejector rumbles]

33:53.531 --> 33:55.992
What are you thinking,
taking out the Soul Ejector here?

33:56.576 --> 33:58.202
I cannot bear it any longer.

33:58.953 --> 34:00.997
I must use the power of the Soul Ejector

34:01.080 --> 34:04.000
and retrieve the ice stone immediately.

34:05.668 --> 34:06.919
Have you gone mad?

34:07.003 --> 34:08.755
You cannot use sorcery
with the Soul Ejector

34:08.838 --> 34:10.506
when the Unanimous Assembly is here.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.966
[scoffs]

34:12.050 --> 34:13.217
Sorcery?

34:16.637 --> 34:19.098
This Soul Ejector came from the ice stone,

34:19.182 --> 34:22.560
but the ice stone is acceptable
while the Soul Ejector is evil.

34:22.643 --> 34:23.811
What ridiculous logic.

34:24.312 --> 34:28.316
That ridiculous logic is the world's order
and gives us justification.

34:28.399 --> 34:31.152
We are going through this whole ordeal
so we can come out to the world

34:31.235 --> 34:33.696
without the disgrace of being sorcerers.

34:34.447 --> 34:35.448
Disgrace?

34:37.033 --> 34:40.286
The Choi family's alchemy of souls
brought us here,

34:40.870 --> 34:42.538
but you are calling that dirty?

34:45.458 --> 34:48.002
I am just saying the alchemy of souls
is a spell

34:48.086 --> 34:50.254
that has yet to receive recognition.

34:51.714 --> 34:54.092
Why do we need the world's recognition?

34:54.801 --> 34:57.970
When you obtained the ice stone
ten years ago at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho,

34:58.054 --> 35:00.223
we could have used the sorcery
to return to the world

35:00.306 --> 35:01.849
in the name of the Choi family.

35:01.933 --> 35:05.937
But you had to make me the Queen
from the Seo family,

35:06.020 --> 35:09.524
you had to form a secret organization
through Cheonbugwan, and now…

35:10.441 --> 35:14.362
you are trying to reveal the ice stone
to the world through Jinyowon.

35:15.696 --> 35:19.742
Was this not because it was impossible
to oppose the whole world as sorcerers?

35:19.826 --> 35:23.663
Not because it was dangerous,
because it was dirty.

35:24.163 --> 35:26.415
You didn't want to be branded a sorcerer,

35:26.499 --> 35:30.837
and you wanted to show your power
and receive recognition out of respect.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.088
[queen laughs]

35:34.173 --> 35:36.676
Why are you so desperate for recognition?

35:38.928 --> 35:42.181
Is it because you hate the fact
you were born a bastard son

35:42.807 --> 35:45.893
of the Jin family,
never to receive recognition

35:45.977 --> 35:47.770
as a member of their bloodline

35:47.854 --> 35:51.941
and spent your life wandering around here
like a dirty dog?

35:52.900 --> 35:54.861
[dark music playing]

35:55.611 --> 35:56.737
[scoffs]

36:04.954 --> 36:10.001
It seems that the honor of being Queen
is too much for a shaman

36:10.084 --> 36:14.297
who used to beg on the street,
offering cheap divinations?

36:15.131 --> 36:16.299
[scoffs]

36:18.634 --> 36:23.431
If you are having a hard time,
I shall bring you some human souls

36:23.514 --> 36:28.352
to consume… and regain your strength.

36:28.853 --> 36:30.229
[scoffs]

36:31.814 --> 36:34.567
[dark music playing]

36:52.960 --> 36:54.754
[breathes shakily]

36:55.296 --> 36:58.382
[Jin] Have you truly found
the real Queen's soul?

36:59.634 --> 37:03.179
And have you brought
that person to Songrim?

37:03.262 --> 37:04.222
[Dang-gu] Yes.

37:04.305 --> 37:06.140
Young Lady Jin is there as we speak.

37:08.976 --> 37:10.728
Bring them to the Training Center.

37:10.811 --> 37:12.355
I'll reveal it in front of everyone.

37:13.064 --> 37:14.190
You cannot do that, My Lord.

37:14.857 --> 37:18.027
You must reveal it
to only the royal family and Jinyowon.

37:19.403 --> 37:23.616
Is the boy who is the sole heir of Songrim

37:23.699 --> 37:27.495
worried that much about Jinyowon
in a critical time like this?

37:29.205 --> 37:30.790
While that does concern me…

37:32.583 --> 37:35.795
this matter also seems to be connected
to Songrim.

37:35.878 --> 37:37.421
[ominous music playing]

37:37.505 --> 37:41.175
They said it was a Songrim mage
who started all of this, sir.

37:41.259 --> 37:44.262
A Songrim mage? Who?

37:45.054 --> 37:48.391
Uk's father,
the Gwanju who's been missing.

37:51.477 --> 37:53.396
[tense music playing]

38:07.743 --> 38:10.288
[Sun] As per the request
of Songrim's leader,

38:10.371 --> 38:14.875
all mages except for those of Cheonbugwan
and Jinyowon have been sent out.

38:14.959 --> 38:16.585
Tell me what is it you have to say?

38:18.087 --> 38:22.633
For some time now, there was someone
the Crown Prince has been looking for.

38:23.384 --> 38:25.428
Park Dang-gu of Jeongjingak,

38:25.511 --> 38:28.681
and Jin Cho-yeon of Jinyowon
have found that person.

38:30.141 --> 38:32.059
Someone the Crown Prince
has been looking for?

38:33.185 --> 38:34.478
Who is that person?

38:36.105 --> 38:38.649
That person is here in this place.

38:43.612 --> 38:45.239
[mage] I hear a stone was thrown over

38:45.323 --> 38:47.700
that said they cannot use spells
inside the ice stone?

38:47.783 --> 38:50.745
Is it stealing all of their energy?

38:50.828 --> 38:53.205
It is the power for the alchemy of souls.

38:53.289 --> 38:56.667
Just as it can steal a person's soul,
it seems it can steal their energy too.

38:56.751 --> 39:00.338
Then, what is going to become
of our children in there?

39:00.421 --> 39:02.631
All you mages wanted to watch

39:02.715 --> 39:05.301
someone die just to witness that power.

39:05.384 --> 39:07.261
Are you finally a little afraid?

39:07.845 --> 39:11.766
The power of the ice stone
cannot be borne by a human being.

39:11.849 --> 39:14.685
That is why Songrim said it be destroyed.

39:14.769 --> 39:16.812
Then Songrim should try to do something.

39:17.355 --> 39:19.315
My son is in there.

39:19.398 --> 39:20.858
And my granddaughter is in there.

39:21.359 --> 39:24.236
Do you think I would be standing here
if I knew what to do?

39:25.571 --> 39:26.572
This problem arose

39:26.655 --> 39:29.533
because we were fighting over
the power of the skies.

39:30.326 --> 39:32.745
Just like the Great Chaos 200 years ago,

39:32.828 --> 39:35.581
I am afraid that many people
will die again.

39:36.165 --> 39:37.249
Seo Gyeong…

39:38.250 --> 39:41.295
Master Seo Gyeong destroyed
the ice stones, did he not?

39:41.379 --> 39:44.215
Is there nothing else he left behind,
maybe the Words of the Heart?

39:44.298 --> 39:48.177
Besides the Words of the Heart,
there is nothing else he left behind.

39:49.220 --> 39:51.472
We are the ones who brought this power,

39:51.555 --> 39:54.183
so one of us has to deal with it.

39:55.142 --> 39:57.728
[Heo Yeom]
Just as Master Seo Gyeong did long ago.

40:04.110 --> 40:06.529
[Go Won] You plan to make it rain
to take away the ice stone's power?

40:08.030 --> 40:09.824
I cannot be certain

40:09.907 --> 40:13.077
whether the rain will fall, or whether
the rain will make the barrier disappear.

40:13.911 --> 40:15.454
One thing is clear though.

40:16.372 --> 40:17.957
If you use Tansu in here,

40:18.916 --> 40:20.000
Jang Uk,

40:20.918 --> 40:22.920
you will lose all of your power at once.

40:24.046 --> 40:25.423
I'm aware of that.

40:25.506 --> 40:27.007
You know, and yet you'll still do it?

40:30.052 --> 40:32.179
Well, it is not as if
you are really that skilled,

40:32.763 --> 40:35.724
but you will still lose everything
you worked for in a single moment.

40:36.392 --> 40:37.935
Can you bear that burden?

40:41.021 --> 40:42.690
I will bear that burden,

40:43.274 --> 40:45.359
so I ask you to bear another,
Your Royal Highness.

40:47.027 --> 40:49.697
If the ice stone does disappear,

40:50.364 --> 40:53.200
I ask that you bear every consequence
that happens afterward.

40:55.870 --> 40:58.456
You may face resentment
from those who sought that power.

40:58.539 --> 41:02.209
Some people may also suspect you
of hiding it somewhere.

41:02.293 --> 41:04.170
So if the ice stone disappears,

41:04.253 --> 41:07.047
you are telling me to let others think
that I did it, not you,

41:07.131 --> 41:08.716
and deal with the aftermath?

41:08.799 --> 41:12.052
You are telling me to take credit
for something that you have done?

41:12.136 --> 41:14.180
I'm asking you to take care

41:14.263 --> 41:16.974
of the resulting fallout
that I will cause.

41:17.641 --> 41:19.560
[pensive music playing]

41:22.062 --> 41:22.980
Jang Uk.

41:23.606 --> 41:26.108
You might not just lose your powers,
you may even lose your life.

41:26.192 --> 41:27.818
Stop bluffing. That's enough.

41:30.988 --> 41:32.907
The master I serve right now

41:33.449 --> 41:36.660
always drove me to the very edge
of the cliff and told me this.

41:37.328 --> 41:40.623
If you're not going to do anything,
you may as well just die.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.960
With the spirit
instead of being full of it,

41:45.044 --> 41:46.462
I'm going to do just that.

41:47.630 --> 41:49.548
Just as my master taught me to.

41:53.802 --> 41:55.721
You have a master? Who?

41:55.804 --> 41:59.642
Who is that? Is it that Master Lee Cheol?

42:01.685 --> 42:02.686
[Mu-deok] Young Master.

42:06.482 --> 42:07.650
I have brought your sword.

42:14.448 --> 42:15.407
Filthy Mu-deok.

42:16.492 --> 42:17.993
Are you not you going to stop
your young master

42:18.077 --> 42:19.537
when he's gonna do something so reckless?

42:20.913 --> 42:24.667
If you are not going to do anything,
then you might as well just die.

42:24.750 --> 42:27.127
[pensive music playing]

42:28.504 --> 42:29.463
Young Master.

42:30.965 --> 42:32.508
Do what you must do.

42:33.092 --> 42:34.134
And please…

42:35.052 --> 42:36.637
succeed no matter what.

42:48.065 --> 42:49.149
[sighs]

42:55.114 --> 42:56.365
The one I will bring here

42:57.241 --> 43:00.119
looks so pitiable that it may be hard
for you to look at.

43:00.703 --> 43:02.037
[Jin] It is said that 20 years ago,

43:02.121 --> 43:05.499
this person suffered severe burns
while evading a Cheonbugwan raid.

43:06.959 --> 43:09.461
[thrilling music playing]

43:11.338 --> 43:13.549
This person was a shaman who practiced

43:14.717 --> 43:16.051
curse divinations.

43:19.179 --> 43:20.431
A shaman?

43:21.181 --> 43:24.977
[Jin] This person has been kept
in a jail-like room near an apothecary

43:25.060 --> 43:28.647
in Gaema Village
like a beast for a very long time.

43:31.108 --> 43:33.944
What reason could someone have to do
such a cruel thing?

43:34.028 --> 43:36.238
It's exactly to uncover that reason

43:36.905 --> 43:39.325
that I asked you to have this meeting,
Your Royal Majesty.

43:41.076 --> 43:42.620
Everyone in this room

43:42.703 --> 43:48.167
is closely related to Shaman Choi
whom I will call forth right now.

43:49.960 --> 43:52.212
- Everyone in this room is--
- [queen] Your Majesty.

43:52.296 --> 43:54.632
Now is not the time to pay mind
to such matters.

43:55.215 --> 43:56.759
You can deal with this once the problem

43:56.842 --> 43:59.595
with the ice stone has been resolved
and the Crown Prince has returned.

44:05.309 --> 44:10.105
Leader of Songrim,
summon that shaman right now.

44:10.689 --> 44:11.940
[breathes shakily]

44:15.653 --> 44:16.987
Come forth.

44:17.488 --> 44:19.740
[suspenseful music playing]

44:34.171 --> 44:35.756
[suspenseful music continues playing]

44:52.314 --> 44:54.149
[dark music playing]

45:04.451 --> 45:08.038
Shaman Choi, reveal your face to us.

45:17.548 --> 45:20.134
[suspenseful music playing]

45:35.524 --> 45:36.984
Your Majesty.
[cries]

45:38.652 --> 45:43.490
I did not think I would live
to see you again.

45:44.575 --> 45:47.327
Do you say you know me?

45:47.411 --> 45:50.330
I am your queen, Your Majesty.

45:50.873 --> 45:54.084
The Queen of Daeho,
Seo Ha-seon, Your Highness.

45:55.043 --> 45:56.044
[queen] Shut your mouth.

45:56.128 --> 45:59.256
How dare you speak my name
with that lowly tongue?

45:59.923 --> 46:01.675
I am the Queen of Daeho.

46:01.758 --> 46:04.011
- You witch.
- [gasps]

46:04.094 --> 46:05.679
Was it not you who did this to me?

46:05.762 --> 46:07.723
You, a foul, lowly shaman,

46:07.806 --> 46:10.559
used the wicked alchemy of souls
to switch our souls

46:10.642 --> 46:12.394
and how dare…

46:13.479 --> 46:17.816
you watched me from up there
occupying my body.

46:17.900 --> 46:20.319
What utterly absurd nonsense.

46:20.402 --> 46:21.445
What are you doing, Jin Mu?

46:22.029 --> 46:24.198
Shut this madwoman's mouth immediately.

46:26.241 --> 46:30.370
[Jin] Let us first confirm
whether her words

46:30.454 --> 46:32.748
are really nonsense or not.

46:34.249 --> 46:35.292
Very well then.

46:36.376 --> 46:39.588
As she is insisting that Her Highness
has somehow shifted her soul,

46:39.671 --> 46:41.465
let's check the Queen for a blue mark.

46:41.548 --> 46:43.884
[tense music playing]

46:46.303 --> 46:50.057
If you suspect me,
you may check all you like.

47:00.484 --> 47:04.112
Will you be satisfied if I reveal
my shoulders to you right here?

47:04.196 --> 47:08.408
It is more than possible
to remove the blue mark entirely.

47:08.492 --> 47:10.911
Then we have no way to prove
what she is saying.

47:13.705 --> 47:15.207
We have the relic Gwigu.

47:15.290 --> 47:17.709
[tense music playing]

47:24.258 --> 47:25.592
In my hand,

47:25.676 --> 47:30.806
I have the ashes of Gwigu, whose corpse
was burned not too long ago.

47:33.016 --> 47:34.977
These remnants of the relic, Gwigu…

47:40.440 --> 47:41.316
will be enough.

47:42.568 --> 47:43.819
[gasps]

47:46.113 --> 47:47.906
No. No.

47:51.201 --> 47:52.411
No. No.

47:52.494 --> 47:54.079
No. No.

48:01.169 --> 48:02.421
That…

48:03.380 --> 48:04.506
was merely…

48:05.799 --> 48:07.509
the ashes that I took

48:08.468 --> 48:09.970
from a brazier.

48:10.053 --> 48:12.639
[intense music playing]

48:23.900 --> 48:25.736
You, yourself, have proved the fact

48:26.320 --> 48:29.823
that you are a soul shifter.

48:29.906 --> 48:31.783
[tense music playing]

48:39.249 --> 48:41.043
[Jin] Take that Shaman Choi immediately,

48:41.126 --> 48:45.339
as she has used the wicked divination
alchemy of souls to possess

48:45.422 --> 48:46.715
Her Highness's body.

48:46.798 --> 48:48.342
- [mages] Yes, my lord.
- [knife clinks]

48:48.425 --> 48:50.594
No! No.

48:52.179 --> 48:55.932
Do not touch her. That is my body.

48:56.683 --> 48:59.936
Do not ruin the body
that I'll need to return to.

49:01.021 --> 49:02.481
[queen] Stay back.

49:04.107 --> 49:08.278
Or else, I swear
that I will rip this body to shreds.

49:08.862 --> 49:10.739
That woman is the descendant

49:10.822 --> 49:14.076
of the Choi family, who caused
the Great Chaos 200 years ago.

49:15.494 --> 49:18.830
The Soul Ejectors that have been used
to create soul shifters

49:19.623 --> 49:22.125
were surely made by her hand as well.

49:23.168 --> 49:24.628
That wicked sorceress

49:24.711 --> 49:27.798
brought forth the ice stone at a meeting
of the Unanimous Assembly

49:28.382 --> 49:30.342
and has made a mockery…

49:31.510 --> 49:33.345
of every mage in Daeho.

49:34.471 --> 49:37.766
The royal family, Cheonbugwan,
and Jinyowon,

49:38.350 --> 49:40.394
we have all been

49:40.477 --> 49:45.524
fooled by this brother and sister
of the Choi family.

49:46.942 --> 49:48.110
Brother and sister?

49:48.193 --> 49:50.570
[thrilling music playing]

49:55.367 --> 49:56.576
Then, is it true?

49:57.703 --> 50:01.123
Do you mean you are related
to this shaman?

50:05.669 --> 50:07.212
Are you of the Choi family?

50:15.429 --> 50:16.888
I am.

50:17.472 --> 50:18.515
[gasps]

50:21.268 --> 50:22.519
I am sorry.

50:25.939 --> 50:28.316
The girl they presented as Jin Bu-yeon

50:28.400 --> 50:30.026
is also an impostor…

50:31.236 --> 50:32.362
that they created.

50:33.739 --> 50:36.867
Their plan was to shift into the body

50:37.951 --> 50:40.287
of the future leader of Jinyowon.

50:40.370 --> 50:42.581
[tense music playing]

50:46.793 --> 50:48.003
[gasps]

50:52.424 --> 50:55.302
[Jin] Shaman Choi, put down the knife,

50:55.385 --> 50:58.346
and calmly return
Her Highness's body to her immediately.

50:58.430 --> 50:59.639
Do so,

51:00.557 --> 51:03.226
and I will spare the life
of your younger brother,

51:04.478 --> 51:05.687
Jin U-tak.

51:17.699 --> 51:19.409
[queen] You dare call me "wicked"?

51:22.078 --> 51:23.955
Do you really think

51:24.748 --> 51:27.793
that any of you here have the right
to call me wicked?

51:29.294 --> 51:30.754
Shall I tell you

51:30.837 --> 51:34.633
how I was able to steal the body
of that precious Queen?

51:36.510 --> 51:37.886
She was tempted

51:37.969 --> 51:40.347
by the promise of a younger,
more beautiful body

51:40.430 --> 51:43.642
using the alchemy of souls
and gladly gave over her body.

51:43.725 --> 51:44.684
Jin Ho-gyeong!

51:46.061 --> 51:48.855
Was it not you who brought the ice stone
out into the world?

51:50.023 --> 51:53.276
The leader of Jinyowon,
who should be protecting its relics,

51:53.360 --> 51:54.694
removed the ice stone

51:54.778 --> 51:58.990
from Jinyowon with her own hands
to be used for the alchemy of souls.

51:59.741 --> 52:03.662
And the one who used it
to practice the alchemy of souls…

52:05.121 --> 52:06.915
was one of the mages of Songrim.

52:07.958 --> 52:09.459
Park Jin.

52:09.543 --> 52:12.462
You knew everything
and decided to hide it.

52:12.963 --> 52:17.175
You're so hypocritical, acting as though
you would capture and kill all sorcerers,

52:17.259 --> 52:22.138
when really, you were just busy
concealing all of their crimes, right?

52:31.982 --> 52:33.316
And you, Jin Mu.

52:34.776 --> 52:37.737
Why do you simply stand there
doing nothing?

52:40.657 --> 52:44.703
According to the logic and rules
of a world built by such people,

52:46.162 --> 52:47.998
am I the only one who's wicked?

52:59.259 --> 53:01.469
To make logic and rules,
you must possess power.

53:01.553 --> 53:06.266
But you have lost that power,
so you are as they said "wicked."

53:10.103 --> 53:12.063
As I expected, Jin Mu,

53:13.106 --> 53:16.985
you truly are a coward who runs away
with his tail between his legs.

53:17.068 --> 53:19.237
Hand over your remaining Soul Ejector.

53:19.905 --> 53:21.823
I will use it to return
Her Highness's body

53:21.907 --> 53:23.575
and let you die
without becoming petrified.

53:24.784 --> 53:29.039
This is the only way you can save
your beloved younger brother.

53:30.123 --> 53:31.041
[U-tak] Sister.

53:31.708 --> 53:34.419
Use the Soul Ejector and run away.

53:36.504 --> 53:39.299
I am sorry that this is all I can do…

53:41.843 --> 53:42.928
for you in the end.

53:44.763 --> 53:45.722
[grunts]

53:45.805 --> 53:47.766
- [screams] Father.
- [gasps]

53:47.849 --> 53:49.517
- [Cho-yeon] Father.
- [grunts]

53:50.518 --> 53:52.479
[Cho-yeon sobs]
Father.

53:54.439 --> 53:55.857
[Cho-yeon crying]

54:12.749 --> 54:14.709
[Cho-yeon] Father.
[sobbing]

54:15.835 --> 54:18.338
[dramatic music playing]

54:18.421 --> 54:20.882
[cackling]

54:34.312 --> 54:35.897
According to your logic and rules,

54:35.981 --> 54:38.608
I shall get rid of that wicked
ice stone for you.

54:38.692 --> 54:39.776
In exchange,

54:40.485 --> 54:42.445
when the ice stone disappears,

54:43.279 --> 54:48.243
everyone inside the barrier
will die along with it.

54:53.832 --> 54:54.958
[rumbling]

55:13.685 --> 55:15.603
[sword clinks]

55:33.204 --> 55:35.457
[screaming]

55:57.353 --> 55:59.397
[thrilling music playing]

56:07.697 --> 56:08.782
[sword clinks]

56:08.865 --> 56:10.492
[thunder rumbles]

56:21.127 --> 56:22.712
[loud rumbling]

56:22.796 --> 56:23.755
[mage 1] What is that?

56:24.339 --> 56:26.716
[all clamoring]

56:37.143 --> 56:39.145
[loud rumbling]

57:06.464 --> 57:09.092
[epic music playing]

57:17.183 --> 57:18.518
[pants]

57:23.731 --> 57:24.566
Jang Gang?

57:25.233 --> 57:26.192
[mage 2] Did he say Jang Gang?

57:26.901 --> 57:29.696
The Gwanju of Cheonbugwan, Jang Gang.

57:30.280 --> 57:32.949
Uh. Are you not Jang Gang? Hmm?

57:33.533 --> 57:35.368
What are you d-doing over here?

57:35.452 --> 57:37.120
[shaky breathing]

57:45.044 --> 57:46.087
[Heo Yeom] Oh.

57:47.213 --> 57:49.632
[Gang panting]

57:59.767 --> 58:01.102
A soul shifter.

58:11.196 --> 58:13.490
The energy of the Soul Ejector
has vanished.

58:14.365 --> 58:17.202
Someone has blocked its power.

58:20.955 --> 58:22.415
My Lord, Gwanju Jang Gang is here.

58:23.583 --> 58:25.668
[tense music playing]

58:39.224 --> 58:40.642
[Jin] Jang Gang.

58:41.851 --> 58:44.604
Did you block the Soul Ejector's energy…

58:46.064 --> 58:47.607
with your body just now?

58:47.690 --> 58:49.609
[somber music playing]

58:54.447 --> 58:57.617
[Heo Yeom] Jin. Keep your distance.

58:57.700 --> 58:59.994
Jang Gang is a soul shifter
and has run wild.

59:00.703 --> 59:01.955
Look.

59:02.038 --> 59:04.916
His whole body is turning to stone.

59:07.544 --> 59:08.419
[Gang] You are right.

59:09.754 --> 59:13.007
I have become a soul shifter by using
the forbidden alchemy of souls

59:13.591 --> 59:14.801
and have run wild.

59:14.884 --> 59:16.219
[gasps]

59:16.302 --> 59:20.056
Is the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan
confessing to having used sorcery?

59:20.139 --> 59:22.976
I'm here because Master Lee Cheol,
a direct disciple of Master Seo Gyeong,

59:24.185 --> 59:27.897
told me to go to the Unanimous Assembly
and confess all of my sins

59:29.148 --> 59:30.817
in the presence of everyone here.

59:35.572 --> 59:38.116
[Master Lee] If you still possess
the energy to read this letter,

59:38.199 --> 59:41.160
expend what energy you have left
for the sake of those

59:41.244 --> 59:42.912
who have borne hardships in your stead.

59:44.372 --> 59:47.166
It is a chance to finish what you started,

59:48.001 --> 59:50.837
so if you do this, a star will rise

59:50.920 --> 59:52.880
and the stone will fall.

59:57.427 --> 59:59.220
[Gang] I am responsible…

01:00:00.305 --> 01:00:03.391
for every fault involving Songrim,
Jinyowon, and Cheonbugwan.

01:00:04.892 --> 01:00:06.936
Bringing forth the ice stone
in the first place,

01:00:08.021 --> 01:00:10.023
using it to start performing sorcery,

01:00:10.815 --> 01:00:14.152
and concealing the fact
that these are all my wrongdoings.

01:00:15.653 --> 01:00:18.573
So I'll petrify right here
to atone for what I've done.

01:00:21.075 --> 01:00:23.953
So all of this started with you,
Gwanju Jang Gang,

01:00:24.037 --> 01:00:26.581
and since you will take the responsibility

01:00:27.665 --> 01:00:28.958
I will permit it.

01:00:36.841 --> 01:00:39.886
Now bear witness
to my most miserable death

01:00:40.595 --> 01:00:42.013
caused by sorcery.

01:00:42.096 --> 01:00:44.098
Even if he is a soul shifter,

01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:45.892
he cannot die right now in this state.

01:00:45.975 --> 01:00:48.478
His son, Jang Uk, is inside Jeongjingak.

01:00:48.561 --> 01:00:51.648
[Heo Yeom]
Please, wait until Uk comes out.

01:00:51.731 --> 01:00:54.609
Doesn't your son deserve
to see his father's end?

01:00:54.692 --> 01:00:56.903
That young man is not my son.

01:00:57.528 --> 01:00:59.572
[Gang] Do you not know
I blocked his gate of energy

01:00:59.656 --> 01:01:01.908
to prevent him from succeeding
my bloodline?

01:01:05.745 --> 01:01:07.205
Don't treat him as a sinner…

01:01:08.706 --> 01:01:11.000
when he has already been born
out of bad luck.

01:01:12.043 --> 01:01:13.461
[breathing heavily]

01:01:23.346 --> 01:01:26.140
[tense music playing]

01:01:39.487 --> 01:01:41.239
[tense music continues playing]

01:01:50.373 --> 01:01:51.833
[grunting]

01:01:54.752 --> 01:01:56.462
[melancholy music playing]

01:02:07.223 --> 01:02:08.474
[gasps]

01:02:10.268 --> 01:02:12.395
[ominous music playing]

01:02:18.776 --> 01:02:19.986
[Jang Uk] Where am I?

01:02:25.992 --> 01:02:28.369
What happened? Am I dead?

01:02:41.424 --> 01:02:42.592
As I expected,

01:02:43.676 --> 01:02:45.261
I have lost all of my powers.

01:03:06.199 --> 01:03:07.492
Is this the ice stone?

01:03:08.701 --> 01:03:12.747
Has it fallen into my hands
now that I'm empty and useless?

01:03:14.290 --> 01:03:15.583
It is just nothing…

01:03:16.793 --> 01:03:18.544
but a mere stone to me now.

01:03:43.110 --> 01:03:44.904
[mage] It is the King's Star.

01:03:44.987 --> 01:03:47.532
The King's Star has appeared.

01:03:47.615 --> 01:03:49.659
[epic music playing]

01:04:10.513 --> 01:04:12.849
[epic music continues playing]

01:04:24.026 --> 01:04:24.986
The King's Star has appeared

01:04:25.069 --> 01:04:26.904
and the barrier around Jeongjingak
is gone, sir.

01:04:41.711 --> 01:04:43.462
[mage 1] The ice stone has vanished,

01:04:44.422 --> 01:04:46.591
and the King's Star
has appeared in the sky.

01:04:47.800 --> 01:04:50.136
[mage 2] The King's Star also appeared
200 years ago

01:04:50.219 --> 01:04:52.597
when Master Seo Gyeong
ended the Great Chaos.

01:04:53.431 --> 01:04:56.601
[mage 1] Then that means someone
among inside Jeongjingak

01:04:56.684 --> 01:04:59.729
has the same destiny as Master Seo Gyeong.

01:05:00.855 --> 01:05:02.690
[epic music playing]

01:05:19.832 --> 01:05:21.667
[mage 1] It is the King's Star.

01:05:21.751 --> 01:05:23.669
It is the King's Star!

01:05:38.601 --> 01:05:40.436
[mage 2] His Royal Highness,

01:05:41.020 --> 01:05:44.106
the Crown Prince is the new King's Star.

01:05:44.190 --> 01:05:46.400
[mages] Your Royal Highness.

01:06:00.998 --> 01:06:03.918
[Jin] The one born under the King's Star
is Jang Uk.

01:06:05.211 --> 01:06:08.005
Is he the one
who got rid of the ice stone?

01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:38.285
[Mu-deok]
So my pupil has lost all his energy.

01:06:40.121 --> 01:06:44.125
[Jang Uk] You have also gone back
to being just Mu-deok, Master.

01:06:46.752 --> 01:06:48.295
But that is all right though.

01:06:49.296 --> 01:06:50.589
Because we are together.

01:06:52.008 --> 01:06:54.093
[gentle music playing]

01:07:12.319 --> 01:07:14.321
[melancholy music playing]

01:07:27.918 --> 01:07:30.004
[mage 1] I heard they're holding
the wedding at Songrim.

01:07:30.087 --> 01:07:32.840
[mage 2] Well, the groom is from Songrim,
so of course, they should hold it there.

01:07:33.340 --> 01:07:35.134
I am against the marriage.

01:07:35.217 --> 01:07:37.636
Those two, getting married?
It is just not right.

01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:39.680
I've seen the two of them side by side.

01:07:39.764 --> 01:07:41.432
I think they look rather good together.

01:07:41.515 --> 01:07:44.310
Have you gone blind?
The groom is way too good for her.

01:07:44.393 --> 01:07:45.770
[mage 2]
Hey, there's nothing wrong with my eyes.

01:07:45.853 --> 01:07:48.397
The way I see it, the bride is the one
who's too good for him.

01:07:48.481 --> 01:07:50.357
Gosh, the whole fortress was abuzz

01:07:50.441 --> 01:07:51.984
with talk of the appearance
of the King's Star,

01:07:52.068 --> 01:07:54.904
but now, interest has moved on
to those two getting married.

01:07:54.987 --> 01:07:55.988
[chuckles softly]

01:07:56.530 --> 01:07:59.784
That is why the leader pushed
to get those two married so quickly.

01:07:59.867 --> 01:08:03.245
The two of them getting married…
I never thought I would see the day.

01:08:05.915 --> 01:08:06.999
[Mu-deok] Young Master Seo.

01:08:07.583 --> 01:08:09.168
I heard that you have not eaten.

01:08:09.960 --> 01:08:11.879
[Seo Yul] I will worry about my own meals.

01:08:11.962 --> 01:08:14.215
[Mu-deok] Shall I make you
noodle soup or something?

01:08:14.298 --> 01:08:15.925
You need to eat to take your medicine.

01:08:18.010 --> 01:08:21.055
They said I do not need to take
that bitter medicine anymore so just stop.

01:08:21.639 --> 01:08:23.516
You said you will be going
to Seoho Fortress soon.

01:08:23.599 --> 01:08:25.559
It is a long journey,
so you have to-- Ugh.

01:08:30.815 --> 01:08:31.857
[sighs]

01:08:31.941 --> 01:08:33.442
My wound has healed.

01:08:34.443 --> 01:08:35.820
And my energy is back.

01:08:37.363 --> 01:08:39.573
They said they heard you groaning
all night long.

01:08:40.491 --> 01:08:41.909
You are lying, right?

01:08:42.868 --> 01:08:44.411
[exhales deeply]

01:08:44.495 --> 01:08:45.996
It does not hurt that much.

01:08:51.961 --> 01:08:55.297
You are very bad at lying,
Young Master Yul.

01:08:57.091 --> 01:09:00.636
You're like clear water
that takes a bit of salt to make it salty,

01:09:00.719 --> 01:09:02.847
a pinch of sugar to make it sweet.

01:09:04.682 --> 01:09:06.100
You are so easy to see through.

01:09:08.602 --> 01:09:11.522
It must have been very difficult for you.

01:09:19.155 --> 01:09:20.322
I am sorry.

01:09:22.449 --> 01:09:23.909
And thank you so much…

01:09:25.786 --> 01:09:26.996
for protecting me.

01:09:33.377 --> 01:09:37.047
[Jang Uk] And Yul has also
been protecting you all this time.

01:09:40.676 --> 01:09:42.720
Yul knows who you are.

01:09:44.096 --> 01:09:45.598
He knew you were a soul shifter,

01:09:45.681 --> 01:09:47.558
and that you were the assassin, Naksu,

01:09:48.434 --> 01:09:50.227
but he's been trying hard
not to let it show.

01:09:55.482 --> 01:09:56.609
To protect you,

01:09:57.401 --> 01:09:59.695
who he met in Danhyanggok
when he was young.

01:10:07.828 --> 01:10:09.288
[Mu-deok] You said

01:10:09.371 --> 01:10:12.499
this belonged to your friend
that you met in Danhyanggok.

01:10:14.001 --> 01:10:15.127
Yes.

01:10:17.213 --> 01:10:18.923
I had planned to bring her

01:10:19.590 --> 01:10:21.675
when I went back to Seoho Fortress.

01:10:27.681 --> 01:10:31.018
Because she is someone
who nobody can know exists.

01:10:33.062 --> 01:10:35.356
I was planning to take her away
and hide her.

01:10:40.152 --> 01:10:41.654
And I promised that

01:10:42.655 --> 01:10:45.574
I would help you
to take that person along with you.

01:10:47.493 --> 01:10:48.494
However,

01:10:49.036 --> 01:10:51.455
she only exists in distant memories

01:10:52.456 --> 01:10:54.333
and is no longer in this world.

01:11:03.717 --> 01:11:06.804
I wondered if burning this object
that is full of memories

01:11:06.887 --> 01:11:08.305
would be a way to help you,

01:11:09.848 --> 01:11:12.476
but you said you liked all your memories
of Danhyanggok.

01:11:18.232 --> 01:11:19.566
Take it with you.

01:11:32.955 --> 01:11:35.082
Let me just feel three breaths…

01:11:36.041 --> 01:11:38.294
to see if the wound is healing well.

01:11:39.878 --> 01:11:42.673
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Sewoon playing]

01:11:59.106 --> 01:12:01.066
During these three deep breaths,

01:12:03.902 --> 01:12:06.697
let us say the final farewell
we were never able to.

01:12:07.323 --> 01:12:10.284
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

01:12:19.209 --> 01:12:21.378
I liked all the memories we shared…

01:12:23.630 --> 01:12:25.507
in Danhyanggok as well.

01:12:32.639 --> 01:12:33.807
Thank you.

01:12:36.018 --> 01:12:38.354
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

01:13:15.057 --> 01:13:17.434
Fortunately, your wound is healing well.

01:13:18.811 --> 01:13:20.020
Still though,

01:13:20.104 --> 01:13:23.273
no matter how bitter it is,
you must keep taking your medicine.

01:13:30.280 --> 01:13:31.407
All right.

01:13:33.283 --> 01:13:35.285
No matter how bitter, I will swallow it.

01:13:40.082 --> 01:13:41.667
It will heal well this time.

01:14:21.165 --> 01:14:24.501
Because your father took responsibility

01:14:24.585 --> 01:14:30.007
for everything in the end
and offered up his own life,

01:14:30.799 --> 01:14:33.969
Songrim and Jinyowon
were not held responsible.

01:14:41.852 --> 01:14:44.188
And him saying you were not his son…

01:14:45.105 --> 01:14:49.693
was also probably to keep you
from… inheriting his sins.

01:14:53.197 --> 01:14:54.323
Do not worry.

01:14:55.032 --> 01:14:59.161
I made my peace
with not being his son a long time ago.

01:15:03.332 --> 01:15:06.793
Can you recognize your father's face?

01:15:07.669 --> 01:15:09.588
You have never really met him, have you?

01:15:12.424 --> 01:15:13.800
I did meet him once though.

01:15:15.219 --> 01:15:16.470
He probably…

01:15:17.930 --> 01:15:19.389
recognized me that day.

01:15:20.474 --> 01:15:21.767
[Jang Uk] It seems that…

01:15:22.476 --> 01:15:24.144
you must already know who I am.

01:15:24.811 --> 01:15:27.147
[Gang] With the sword
of the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,

01:15:27.231 --> 01:15:28.732
you must be his son.

01:16:00.639 --> 01:16:04.017
[Jin] I present the sword and robes
that were bestowed upon Jang Gang,

01:16:04.101 --> 01:16:07.396
the former Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,
who died as a result of sorcery.

01:16:07.479 --> 01:16:12.192
Please make your decree
for what should be done with them.

01:16:12.776 --> 01:16:14.236
You will keep them at Songrim.

01:16:15.654 --> 01:16:17.739
Have you located the missing
Assistant Gwanju, Jin Mu?

01:16:18.490 --> 01:16:19.616
We are on his trail.

01:16:20.617 --> 01:16:23.412
We are certain that he has been unable
to leave the capital.

01:16:23.495 --> 01:16:25.205
He may have left in a different body.

01:16:26.456 --> 01:16:28.875
If he shifted his soul,
as it was done to me,

01:16:28.959 --> 01:16:30.544
would you recognize him?

01:16:31.670 --> 01:16:33.880
You've all been fooled for so long,
have you not?

01:16:35.757 --> 01:16:36.592
[coughs]

01:16:37.801 --> 01:16:39.136
[Heo Yeom] Your Highness.

01:16:39.219 --> 01:16:42.931
At Sejukwon, we were able to save
Master Kang of Daegangtongun

01:16:43.015 --> 01:16:45.100
who had run wild and petrified.

01:16:45.726 --> 01:16:49.271
Even if the body Your Highness shifted
into should run wild,

01:16:49.354 --> 01:16:51.189
there is a way to treat you.

01:16:52.441 --> 01:16:53.734
Even so,

01:16:54.276 --> 01:16:58.947
I'll still be trapped in this awful body
for the rest of my life.

01:16:59.031 --> 01:17:00.449
[queen breathes heavily]

01:17:01.074 --> 01:17:02.743
How can you spare Jang Uk,

01:17:02.826 --> 01:17:06.038
the son of that detestable Jang Gang
who did this to me?

01:17:06.121 --> 01:17:07.414
[Jin] Jang Gang…

01:17:07.998 --> 01:17:10.500
took responsibility for this
with his life,

01:17:11.418 --> 01:17:13.378
and Jang Uk, the eldest son of Jang Gang,

01:17:14.254 --> 01:17:17.841
has also been stripped of his right
to succeed him as Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

01:17:19.051 --> 01:17:20.844
They have paid for their sins

01:17:21.720 --> 01:17:24.139
by losing everything they have.

01:17:25.932 --> 01:17:29.478
As he died, Jang Gang
said the boy was not his blood.

01:17:29.561 --> 01:17:31.605
We can't punish Jang Uk for this.

01:17:31.688 --> 01:17:35.359
So, Jang Gang never revealed
who Jang Uk's father was even in the end.

01:17:43.533 --> 01:17:45.285
Lord Jang Gang asked me

01:17:46.119 --> 01:17:48.413
to present this box to you.

01:17:53.251 --> 01:17:55.587
He said that it was an item
that could prove

01:17:56.838 --> 01:17:59.049
who the young master's real father is.

01:18:00.425 --> 01:18:01.927
[breathes deeply]

01:18:05.472 --> 01:18:07.974
[suspenseful music playing]

01:18:22.322 --> 01:18:23.490
So you…

01:18:24.741 --> 01:18:27.828
know now, too, Maidservant Kim.

01:18:29.413 --> 01:18:30.872
I cannot believe it.

01:18:31.915 --> 01:18:35.711
Did Lady Do-hwa
give birth to the child of the late king?

01:18:36.378 --> 01:18:39.548
Uk was born to the late King

01:18:40.674 --> 01:18:43.385
who shifted his own soul to Jang Gang.

01:18:43.969 --> 01:18:47.139
He performed the alchemy of souls…

01:18:50.475 --> 01:18:52.811
to temporarily swap their souls.

01:18:54.187 --> 01:18:59.025
So Jang Gang really
twisted the fate of his own son, Jang Uk.

01:19:00.861 --> 01:19:02.487
If the young master knows…
[sobs]

01:19:03.989 --> 01:19:05.365
I won't let him know.

01:19:07.075 --> 01:19:10.704
I'll make sure that no one else,

01:19:11.872 --> 01:19:13.832
ever finds out about it.

01:19:17.836 --> 01:19:19.045
They say that the King's Star

01:19:19.129 --> 01:19:21.298
which appeared the night
you made the ice stone disappear

01:19:21.381 --> 01:19:23.633
has been engraved on a plaque
here in Cheonbugwan.

01:19:23.717 --> 01:19:25.135
Everybody is truly overjoyed

01:19:25.218 --> 01:19:27.387
that a king with the King's Star
has emerged.

01:19:27.471 --> 01:19:28.764
[Eunuch Oh] Would you like to see it?

01:19:31.057 --> 01:19:32.225
No, it's fine.

01:19:44.613 --> 01:19:45.989
Has the Assistant Gwanju…

01:19:47.032 --> 01:19:48.867
really shifted his soul and fled?

01:19:50.118 --> 01:19:52.287
[foreboding music playing]

01:20:20.190 --> 01:20:22.400
Have you been hiding inside Cheonbugwan?

01:20:22.901 --> 01:20:26.112
I've been waiting for an opportunity
to meet with you, sire.

01:20:27.405 --> 01:20:28.698
[Go Won sighs]

01:20:28.782 --> 01:20:31.076
So that you can beg me to spare you?

01:20:31.159 --> 01:20:33.620
You are the only one
who can save me now, sire.

01:20:33.703 --> 01:20:37.541
But the only one who can protect you
is me, your master.

01:20:38.291 --> 01:20:41.044
What is there for you
to protect me from now?

01:20:41.127 --> 01:20:44.047
I shall protect you from the owner
of the fated King's Star.

01:20:45.090 --> 01:20:48.343
- The owner of the King's Star?
- You also know

01:20:48.426 --> 01:20:50.846
that it does not belong to you, right?

01:20:56.726 --> 01:20:58.854
The one who shall outshine your light.

01:20:58.937 --> 01:21:01.231
That is the one who everyone
shall worship instead of you.

01:21:01.314 --> 01:21:04.568
The one who will bring you to your end.

01:21:05.151 --> 01:21:06.570
The owner of the King's Star

01:21:06.653 --> 01:21:09.698
who must not appear
beside Your Royal Highness

01:21:10.407 --> 01:21:11.658
is in fact, Jang Uk.

01:21:13.827 --> 01:21:18.498
I, Jin Mu, shall be sure to extinguish
that ominous light for Your Highness.

01:21:19.541 --> 01:21:21.626
[suspenseful music playing]

01:21:24.296 --> 01:21:26.256
So the thing that I desired…

01:21:29.259 --> 01:21:30.844
belonged to Jang Uk.

01:21:38.351 --> 01:21:41.021
[tranquil music playing]

01:21:57.746 --> 01:21:58.955
[Ju-wol gasps]

01:21:59.039 --> 01:22:02.083
Gorgeous. You look lovely.

01:22:03.668 --> 01:22:06.671
So beautiful.

01:22:06.755 --> 01:22:08.465
- Oh…
- [Ju-wol clicks tongue, chuckles]

01:22:08.548 --> 01:22:10.008
Close your mouth.

01:22:10.592 --> 01:22:11.676
Time to take it off.

01:22:11.760 --> 01:22:14.471
But why did you ask me
to try this on though?

01:22:14.554 --> 01:22:15.555
What is the bride doing though?

01:22:15.639 --> 01:22:17.015
She could not make the appointment

01:22:17.098 --> 01:22:18.975
because her father
is in critical condition.

01:22:19.059 --> 01:22:21.436
So I'm having you try the dress on
since you have a similar build.

01:22:21.519 --> 01:22:23.229
[Ju-wol] Go change.

01:22:23.313 --> 01:22:24.689
Oh…

01:22:24.773 --> 01:22:27.025
What are you doing?
Get out so she can change.

01:22:27.108 --> 01:22:30.695
- [man] She is a goddess
- [Ju-wol] Stop gawking, let us go.

01:22:30.779 --> 01:22:32.113
A goddess.

01:22:32.197 --> 01:22:33.490
[both chuckle]

01:22:35.909 --> 01:22:37.035
Do I…

01:22:37.994 --> 01:22:39.621
look that pretty?

01:22:41.456 --> 01:22:42.540
- Oh, excuse me.
- Mm?

01:22:42.624 --> 01:22:44.376
Mu-deok is here, right? Where is she?

01:22:44.459 --> 01:22:45.710
Oh, Mu-deok is…

01:22:47.754 --> 01:22:50.340
[chuckles]
She is in the room up there.

01:22:50.423 --> 01:22:51.883
- Go ahead.
- Thanks.

01:22:52.384 --> 01:22:54.135
[quirky music playing]

01:22:55.011 --> 01:22:56.721
[chuckles]

01:22:56.805 --> 01:22:59.432
[Mu-deok humming]

01:23:02.852 --> 01:23:03.853
Wow.

01:23:04.646 --> 01:23:06.690
I heard there was a bride
getting married soon.

01:23:07.774 --> 01:23:08.692
So it was you?

01:23:09.609 --> 01:23:10.610
It is not.

01:23:14.656 --> 01:23:17.617
Ah, now that I look closer,
I see it's my master.

01:23:18.326 --> 01:23:20.495
[Jang Uk] I told you to wait at Sejukwon
because I had something to tell you.

01:23:20.578 --> 01:23:23.123
- What are you doing here?
- I came to get wine for Heo Yeom,

01:23:23.206 --> 01:23:25.166
and Ju-wol asked me to try this on.

01:23:25.250 --> 01:23:28.086
I'm going to change,
so go outside and wait.

01:23:28.169 --> 01:23:29.462
No. No, no.

01:23:29.546 --> 01:23:32.674
We can just do it here.
We first met here, after all.

01:23:32.757 --> 01:23:33.883
[quirky music playing]

01:23:33.967 --> 01:23:35.885
[stutters]
What? Do what though?

01:23:35.969 --> 01:23:37.053
Hmm…

01:23:37.721 --> 01:23:40.098
it's about a very important ceremony.

01:23:40.181 --> 01:23:42.726
Yes. First of all, let's sit here.

01:23:53.611 --> 01:23:55.071
What are you doing, Jang Uk?

01:23:55.905 --> 01:23:57.115
You don't have to do this.

01:24:00.744 --> 01:24:04.164
Gosh, you're embarrassing me right now.
Just stop it.

01:24:06.499 --> 01:24:07.500
[Jang Uk chuckles softly]

01:24:09.335 --> 01:24:11.212
It's embarrassing the first time,

01:24:11.296 --> 01:24:13.089
but by the 13th time, it is easy.

01:24:14.382 --> 01:24:15.467
What?

01:24:16.092 --> 01:24:18.178
You proposed 13 times already?

01:24:18.803 --> 01:24:19.888
[chuckles]

01:24:20.680 --> 01:24:21.806
Master.

01:24:22.515 --> 01:24:26.061
Your pupil will end his training
as of today.

01:24:26.144 --> 01:24:28.188
[gentle music playing]

01:24:29.147 --> 01:24:32.150
Thank you for pushing your useless pupil
off the edge of the cliff

01:24:32.734 --> 01:24:34.986
so that he was able to reach this point.

01:24:37.155 --> 01:24:38.323
Although…

01:24:38.406 --> 01:24:40.784
you gave up your opportunity
to regain your power

01:24:41.576 --> 01:24:44.829
and your pupil
gave up all the energy he gathered,

01:24:45.622 --> 01:24:49.667
I've gained a precious person
to keep by my side for a lifetime.

01:24:49.751 --> 01:24:52.253
[gentle music continues playing]

01:24:53.463 --> 01:24:57.884
Instead of using and tossing her aside,
I'd like to protect and cherish her.

01:24:58.551 --> 01:25:01.346
So permit me to end my training.

01:25:06.893 --> 01:25:08.394
Your master, Mu-deok,

01:25:09.479 --> 01:25:11.815
permits her pupil, Jang Uk,
to end his training.

01:25:15.527 --> 01:25:17.403
[sighs] All right. So now, then.

01:25:18.613 --> 01:25:21.449
Marry your young master, Mu-deok.

01:25:23.243 --> 01:25:26.037
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

01:25:27.872 --> 01:25:28.915
[chuckles softly]

01:25:30.542 --> 01:25:33.461
["Breath" continues playing]

01:25:51.938 --> 01:25:52.981
[all cheering]

01:25:53.565 --> 01:25:56.067
Yes. I've decided I'm going
to get married to him.

01:25:56.568 --> 01:25:58.778
- What other woman do you have around you?
- This all belongs to Mu-deok.

01:25:58.862 --> 01:26:00.572
[maid Kim] That cannot be.

01:26:00.655 --> 01:26:04.450
[Jin Mu] I will find the sword for you
that can destroy Jang Uk's light.

01:26:04.534 --> 01:26:06.870
We have to find him
and kill him immediately.

01:26:06.953 --> 01:26:10.498
Are you saying that they all deceived me
and have been mocking me this whole time?

01:26:10.582 --> 01:26:12.876
[Jin Mu]
They are hiding it to protect him.

01:26:12.959 --> 01:26:15.003
An assassin has appeared in Sejukwon.

01:26:15.086 --> 01:26:17.505
[Master Lee] It seems the original owner
of Mu-deok's body

01:26:17.589 --> 01:26:19.591
used to have a great amount
of divine powers.

01:26:19.674 --> 01:26:20.800
- [Jin Mu] Naksu.
- [bell dinging]

01:26:20.884 --> 01:26:23.178
You have given me a way to live.
